config BR2_PACKAGE_STREMIO
	bool "stremio (media center)"
	select BR2_PACKAGE_BATOCERA_PODMAN
	help
	  Installs a batocera-stremio wrapper, launched from ES's own HOME menu
	  (where Kodi used to be - see ApiSystem::launchKodi), that runs
	  Stremio - the next-gen media center - via the existing container_apps
	  system inside the shared desktop-apps OCI image (openbox + picom +
	  Brave + Limusic + Stremio - see containers/desktop-apps/) that
	  limusic already builds, embeds and loads.

	  https://github.com/Stremio/stremio-shell
